@patterns.repository

Purpose:
  Abstraction over data source.

Owns: references\patterns\repository.sdd
UseWhen:
  - need to decouple domain from persistence
  - multiple data sources possible
  - testability is required

AvoidWhen:
  - simple CRUD without domain logic
  - no persistence layer

Why:
  Mediates between domain and data mapping layers.

Related:
  @ddd.repository
  @architecture.hexagonal

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
